sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Sistema emisor
  participant R as REST adapter
  participant U as EmitirGuiaRemision
  participant X as ubl+signing
  participant G as sunat-rest
  participant SEC as api-seguridad
  participant CPE as api-cpe
  participant T as TicketPoller
  participant P as persistence

  C->>R: POST /v1/guias-remision
  R->>U: emitir
  U->>X: UBL DespatchAdvice → firmar
  U->>P: guardar FIRMADO
  U->>G: enviar(tenant, nombre.zip, zip)
  G->>G: token en caché válido?
  opt no
    G->>SEC: POST /oauth2/token (client_id, secret, RUC+usuario, clave)
    SEC-->>G: access_token, expires_in
  end
  G->>G: base64(zip), SHA-256(zip)
  G->>CPE: POST /comprobantes/{ruc}-{09|31}-{serie}-{num} Bearer
  CPE-->>G: {numTicket, fecRecepcion}
  G-->>U: ticket
  U->>P: ENVIADO + ticket · outbox(CONSULTAR_TICKET)
  R-->>C: 202 {id, estado: ENVIADO, ticket}
  T->>CPE: GET /comprobantes/envios/{ticket}
  alt codRespuesta 98
    CPE-->>T: en proceso
  else 0
    CPE-->>T: arcCdr base64
    T->>P: ACEPTADO + CDR
  else 99
    CPE-->>T: error + arcCdr?
    T->>P: RECHAZADO (numeración no consumida) o ERROR_ENVIO
  end
